node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
# Next's standalone output copies an app's .env and .env.production into .next/standalone
# (writeStandaloneDirectory in next/dist/build/index.js), and the server loads them at runtime.
# A local build on a tree that holds real values would ship them in the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
